nodes.body:
@sfeng33 Hi — @yewentao256 suggested you as the better reviewer for this PR.

This fixes truncated HY v3/v4 streaming tool calls leaving unterminated JSON arguments. The current change is scoped to the HY parsers plus focused regression coverage for truncated and complete streams.

The two points I’d especially appreciate your review on are:

* whether finalizing the withheld argument tail from the incremental parser state is the right behavior;
* whether the HYV4 regex adjustment is appropriately scoped.

When you have a chance, could you take a look? Happy to address anything you find. Thanks!

